Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋製作  僅供交流試看之用  請勿用於商業用途\N翻譯：飛魚　校對：Nemeton　後期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.00,0:00:-03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎有人想叛離忍者村
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.09,0:00:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,首領已親自命令我殺掉可疑分子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你們不久後應該也會收到命令
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.71,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,當然 不管是誰 我都不會放過
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,即便對方是你重要的同伴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我在這裡獲得了名字 找到了榮譽和活著的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,只有這裡能容下我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我要作為忍者成就大義
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,威脅大義者…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,都該被肅清
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我們已經做了力所能及的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就算現在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,總有一天 在也會明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,該下決心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,雷公驅雲散 今日不敢鳴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,奧義 迅雷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕你能復活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我也會無數次殺死你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,朝陽起 湖面平靜泛波光
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,執槳行舟亦無痕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,奧義 幽靜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他把五感提升到了極限…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 還要更高
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你本就知道那兩人會叛逃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,為甚麼放走他們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.89,0:04:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,答不上來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,當了叛忍 被追殺是理所當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這都是你自找的 彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是你輕視戒律和大義
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就不會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我們沒有輕視
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我們只是想明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不存在即便捨棄所愛之物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.62,0:05:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,捨棄想保護的事物也要遵守的戒律
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也不存在必須成就的大義
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾說過只有村子能容下你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是村子已容不下我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那為甚麼要立下盟約
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,為甚麼要說那種謊話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,和你們同行 能看到不同的景色嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能看到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一起前行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我第一次相信自己有了同伴 有了朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你背叛的不僅是村子 還有我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是謊話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你對我們而言也很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,開甚麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那個花紋…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這是為了不忘記你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我們一直在追尋 和你說過的不同的景色…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,又想騙我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.99,0:06:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會停下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我必須終結忍者 終結你所重視的這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要向你…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那就來證明一下誰是對的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,用實踐來證明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,向你展示我所相信的正確
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 肯定… 沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠說過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算讓他得償所願
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他是出於戒律 還是仇恨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:08:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但不論如何 都得請他放過蓮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蓮肯定能讓在看到不同的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這個小生命會讓他明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也能夠擁有自己的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在 有朝一日為彼此的現在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,做個了結吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,該死 沒有辦法嗎 沒有辦法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,別嚇我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那你上鎖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,烤鴨呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,跑去以前忍者待過的廢墟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛走 就有戰書寄來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,戰書? 誰下的?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,該死 這時搞這一齣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你那個想法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 事態惡化了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,追兵馬上就來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,資料呢 到手了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,找到存在哪裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,下一步就需要艾瑪的生物特徵認證了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我試了很多辦法 都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我也調查過後面的實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,別說指紋了 一根頭髮都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她簡直是透明人 行走的加密軟體
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,拿不到資料 之前做的一切都會白費
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,別衝我發火
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你不也搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要喝點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要久違地喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,畫得不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你覺得它是詛咒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但有時它說不定會成為你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 很抱歉突然打電話來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有點事想和你說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,還記得第一次見面時的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,當時國防部長告訴我 讓忍者當我的護衛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我還以為是惡劣的玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但你們做事利索
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不夾雜任何感情的高專業素養
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我深受感動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:11:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才接受了你們想製造具足裝備的提議
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是 測試並發展我司的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣是最理想的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很有趣 我很興奮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但你似乎不那麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,目前的情況不是很樂觀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,具足裝備和反應爐的開發資料已到手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我們可以自主建設產線了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,時機已到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 老頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為我看不透你打的甚麼算盤?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我總是把改變世界掛在嘴邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但還沒說過具體怎麼個改法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,山路 我是厭倦了這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:12:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只要得到{\fsp8}了{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}開發的奇蹟般的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,世界就會大幅改變
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,人們的生活將變得格外豐富
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,各種問題都會得到解決
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,同樣地 戰爭也會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.83,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,武器的威力會提升 以往的常識將被顛覆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的控制下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,人類將邁向下一個階梯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我答應會好好使用你們的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,別了 山路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,約瑟夫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不論哪件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,為甚麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,別了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他們是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,發現嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,正{\fsp8}在{\r}1{\fsp8}6{\r}號公路上向西北方逃竄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,請求增援
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,約瑟夫先生 請走這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要殺您的話 我早動手了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.08,0:16:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 樓頂有直升機
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.62,0:16:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,來不及的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,直接去實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把車停下 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,下來 雙手放到地上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,之後就交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這上面有艾瑪的指紋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,追兵已經來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我來爭取時間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只是要賭一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經能看{\fsp8}到{\r}CE{\fsp8}O{\r}大人那張苦瓜臉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,身後交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,請您放鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就算沒打中 我也會想辦法搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.94,0:17:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,比{\fsp8}起{\r}FP{\fsp8}S{\r}遊戲 還是實戰更好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.69,0:17:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你那套可改變不了世界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你也相當傲慢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉 你也要背叛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不是您命令我來保護約瑟夫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那你試試把命令執行到底
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,迪… 莉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這次新找出了兩個人的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一個是彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,另一個是鞠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,還有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他們的孩子 也得殺掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.52,0:20:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是為了大義
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在 能下手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.51,0:20:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜歡星星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.97,0:21:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,並不是 只是這樣能讓我想起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,從前太弱小 只能一直盯著地面的時日
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,以此警示自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡的忍者都有著不幸的過往
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不想總被詛咒般的過往束縛住
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,過往不會消失不見
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但我們能自行改變看事物的角度
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.01,0:21:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我們應該也能放下過往 注視著未來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,甚麼是未來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.51,0:21:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 但感覺總有一天我會明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那或許就是不同的景色吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,最好如此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.55,0:21:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠說過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:22:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,蓮肯定能讓在看到不同的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這個小生命會讓他明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也能夠擁有自己的未來
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.00,0:00:-03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs55}註：出自萬葉集 卷十九 4235
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs55}註：出自拾玉集 第四 5106
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.00,0:00:-03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.00,0:00:-03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Comment: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:45.04,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Comment: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:50.37,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Comment: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:55.63,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Comment: 0,0:21:56.30,0:22:00.38,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Comment: 0,0:22:02.93,0:22:08.06,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Comment: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:12.98,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Comment: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:17.53,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:22.74,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Comment: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:28.04,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Comment: 0,0:22:28.62,0:22:33.17,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Comment: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:38.51,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Comment: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:43.18,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:46.14,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:45.04,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}當記憶漸漸模糊
Comment: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:50.37,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Comment: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:55.63,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}後悔與折磨長留心中
Comment: 0,0:21:56.30,0:22:00.38,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我們絕望迷失
Comment: 0,0:22:02.93,0:22:08.06,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在尋找理由的旅途之中
Comment: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:12.98,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}當隊伍開始分崩離析
Comment: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:17.53,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被拋棄之人的面龐揮之不去
Comment: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:22.74,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}閉上眼睛想忘記愧疚
Comment: 0,0:22:22.74,0:22:28.04,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}誰會留下伸出援手
Comment: 0,0:22:28.62,0:22:33.17,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}當死亡已經近在咫尺
Comment: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:38.51,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}誰會獨自戰鬥追尋正義
Comment: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:43.18,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}為那些被拋棄的人們
Comment: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:46.14,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被拋棄的人們
Comment: 0,0:00:-03.00,0:00:-03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
